# Admin Dashboard

Dokan Kits implements a modern React-based admin dashboard for managing plugin settings and features.

## Directory Structure

- [src/admin/](mdc:src/admin): Main admin code
  - [components/](mdc:src/admin/components): Reusable React components
  - [context/](mdc:src/admin/context): React context providers
  - [hooks/](mdc:src/admin/hooks): Custom React hooks
  - [pages/](mdc:src/admin/pages): Admin page components

## Key Admin Files

- [includes/Admin/Dashboard/Manager.php](mdc:includes/Admin/Dashboard/Manager.php): PHP class that registers admin pages
- [includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages/](mdc:includes/Admin/Dashboard/Pages): PHP classes for admin pages
- [src/admin/pages/dashboard/](mdc:src/admin/pages/dashboard): React components for dashboard pages

## Form Fields

The admin dashboard uses a collection of reusable form field components:

- [src/admin/components/fields/](mdc:src/admin/components/fields): Form field components
  - Text fields, select boxes, toggles, etc.

## Admin Hooks

The admin dashboard provides several hooks for extending functionality:

```php
// Add a new admin page
add_filter('dokan_kits_admin_pages', function($pages) {
    $pages[] = [
        'title' => 'My Custom Page',
        'slug' => 'my-custom-page',
        'callback' => 'my_custom_page_callback',
    ];
    return $pages;
});

// Add custom admin scripts
add_action('dokan_kits_admin_enqueue_scripts', function() {
    wp_enqueue_script('my-custom-script', 'path/to/script.js');
});
```
